  <title>Draft invoices</title>

  <p>The <gui>Draft Invoices</gui> button of the main window lists every
  invoice that has at least one line but has not been posted. Documents
  unchecked as <gui>Active</gui> in an invoice's <link
  xref="invoice#document_list">document list</link> are left out. The list
  updates by itself as invoices change.</p>

  <list>
    <item><p>Double click an invoice, or select it and click <gui>Open invoice
    in invoice window</gui>, to finish it. Check <gui>Hide when opening
    invoice</gui> to have this window step out of the way when you
    do.</p></item>
    <item><p><gui>New invoice</gui> opens a blank <link
    xref="invoice"/>.</p></item>
    <item><p>Right click an invoice and choose <gui>Contact hub</gui> to see
    everything about its customer.</p></item>
    <item><p><gui>Save window layout</gui>, in the window menu, remembers the
    window's size, column widths and sorting, on this computer.</p></item>
  </list>

</page>
